kind":"p","text":"P2櫃鎖上、鑰匙由指定人保管","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"課研主任","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"已就位","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"□","images":[],"heading":false}]],[[{"kind":"p","text":"08:50 訪談代表集合與最後說明","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"再說一次：可以拒答、可以說不知道","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"課研主任","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"三組代表均到","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"□","images":[],"heading":false}]],[[{"kind":"p","text":"08:55 迎賓與引導定位","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"校門、川堂、會議室各1人","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"總務","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"已定位","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"□","images":[],"heading":false}]],[[{"kind":"p","text":"每段結束即時回報時間","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"超時立即通知主持人壓縮下一段","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"課研主任","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"每段回報","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"□","images":[],"heading":false}]],[[{"kind":"p","text":"綜合座談待辦即時記錄","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"委員每一項建議當場記成可執行事項與主責","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"教導主任","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"座談結束當日交初稿","images":[],"heading":false}],[{"kind":"p","text":"□","images":[],"heading":false}]]]},{"kind":"p","text":"當日五個不要","images":[],"heading":false},{"kind":"p","text":"・不要臨時抽換簡報內容——委員手上是書審過的自評報告，臨時新數字會被視為口徑不一致。","images":[],"heading":false},{"kind":"p","text":"・不要替學生或家長補充回答；委員問誰就由誰回答。","images":[],"heading":false},{"kind":"p","text":"・不要說「這個我們有做只是沒有紀錄」——沒有紀錄就說正在建置並給期程。","images":[],"heading":false},{"kind":"p","text":"・不要把115年7月後新建的制度講成113至115學年度既有成效。","images":[],"heading":false},{"kind":"p","text":"・不要讓委員在資料展示區找不到東西；找不到比沒有更傷。","images":[],"heading":false},{"kind":"p","text":"寧埔國小　115學年度學校型態實驗教育評鑑　實地評鑑當日執行手冊　／　版本日期：115年9月2日　／　凡「【待填】」標記者為待填欄位，須由校長核定後填入。","images":[],"heading":false}]}]}